<title>USA: US '98 budget sees 3.8 bln board feet timber sales.</title>
<headline>US '98 budget sees 3.8 bln board feet timber sales.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Clinton administration would offer 3.8 billion board feet of timber for sale in natonal forests in fiscal 1998, according to budget documents released Thursday.</p>
<p>By comparison, 4.2 billion board feet were forecast to be sold this fiscal year. About 3.4 billion board feet were sold in fiscal 1996.</p>
</text>
